<title>USA: Northern Ill. University repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Northern Ill. University repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets Inc said Thursday it repriced Northern Illinois University's $50 million bond issue, raising the yields in 2016 and 2022 to 5.85 percent and 5.90 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
